{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b65cfbfd959336b1e5c5ddf80206cd088516ee681ac70cb610cb551466f6f4ca", "ja": "（そろそろ、次の定期公演の準備だな。\n考えている事があるから、まずは話をして……）", "zh": "（差不多该准备下一场定期公演了。\n我有些想法，先去聊聊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1001_junior", "source_sha256": "42b0d0925af48e0c293077fea380943198997cb083b14fa7728de966ee7ed5c1", "ja": "わんっ。わんわんわん♪", "zh": "汪。汪汪汪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8934b0e6972ed74b6af3ecd2b21a0674e6468ffdb4272990b07c86937568ff38", "ja": "あれっ？　ジュニオールじゃないか、よしよし。\n星梨花は控え室かな？　丁度よかった。", "zh": "咦？这不是小朱尼尔吗，乖孩子乖孩子。\n星梨花是在休息室吗？正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "e8bf5041dd38fe2eba71cdfc95ca4106a9c46c290e802f0908e84037463a7153", "ja": "そうだ！　今からみんなで、公園に行きませんか？\nジュニオールのお気に入りのボールもあります。", "zh": "对了！现在要不要和大家一起去公园？\n还有朱尼奥最喜欢的球。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "99ce48fbf7dc6ff3a8ec55f5595cde4b0c4e68c9a9f52c63d652e7ceb203c5fa", "ja": "いいねいいね、楽しそう♪\nふたりも公園まで、ジュニオールとかけっこしよ！", "zh": "好啊好啊，听起来很有意思♪\n你们两个也和朱尼奥尔一起赛跑到公园去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7e8c17c338458754b2be4cf6fd8e29e4d628750c1aa49d70146c2c9a90e3bf78", "ja": "あれ？　これからどこかに出かけるのか？", "zh": "哎？等下是要出门去哪儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "c749b90a0aa8b29176927edafba84c95cb827b4f247365374fa8d3d8bd76c416", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nはい、今日はジュニオールが一緒なんです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n是的，今天朱尼奥尔也会一起去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "7c7ee5c5b964bbdcc983695e4adbe3f72b763cf40222d7e9157d66d844e652a5", "ja": "だから、みんなで公園に行こうって。\nレッスンまでには帰ってきます。いいですか？", "zh": "所以，想和大家一起去公园。我们会在上课前回来的，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1008_p", "source_sha256": "578ec17a0da65310ae71e21d2f82a70c37bfc8e03df43b410aa802dd9c2898bc", "ja": "ああ、いいよ。でも、ケガだけはしないようにな。\n海美と未来が一緒なら、大丈夫だとは思うけど。", "zh": "啊，可以。不过可千万别受伤了。\n海美和未来一起去的话，我想应该没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "2be8e248a13e23e448e706c21dd004940980680f4b97969d15aa9acd159be990", "ja": "任せてよ{$P$}！\n私たち、せりりんのお姉ちゃんだもんね。", "zh": "交给我吧{$P$}！\n我们可是小星梨的姐姐嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "8e6eb4e62b19c3e930bc4ed3d8d42cec5babc098b5062520d0f7702bc6634497", "ja": "そうそう、どーんと任せてください！\nあっ、そういえば、レッスンって何時からでしたっけ？", "zh": "对对，尽管交给我吧！\n啊，对了，说起来，训练是几点开始来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1222f84bfe1d3450b4c7ea8446bcc75466c1a2329f25d4aed51c3df7e269ca6c", "ja": "なんか心配になってきたけど……。\nっと……その前に少し、星梨花に話があるんだ。", "zh": "总觉得有点担心了……。\n对了……在那之前，我有点事要跟星梨花说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4235399ca878b028eadaf9b5eafe5f09e9bfd783ed9924a8be22e9c7b6f02fa6", "ja": "今度の定期公演で、星梨花の新曲を\n用意しようと思うんだけど。どうかな？", "zh": "我想在下次的定期公演上为星梨花准备一首新歌。你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "911397b7dc68d604941fcc2d8811e8dfabbd5618951f12202f56d38d312684ef", "ja": "えっ！　わたしに、新しい曲を……？\nわぁ、ありがとうございます！　うれしいです♪", "zh": "诶！要为我准备新歌……？\n哇，谢谢您！我好开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "9255c9acb8e95dafa509af9d7a5d6c239d49877f93a5b3f15cc839440acd53b4", "ja": "やったね、星梨花！　どんな曲なのかな～？\n{$P$}さん、聴かせてください！", "zh": "太棒啦，星梨花！会是什么样的曲子呢～？\n{$P$}先生，请放给我们听听吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ced858e31d33d26c89e613e76d7e16c8b988ddb486213c8301a85b9d6140b528", "ja": "いや、これから作るんだ。\n星梨花の希望を聞いてから発注しようと思って。", "zh": "不，是接下来才要制作。\n我想先听听星梨花的希望，再去下单。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6bba43bc688b80808abf0ad257d175226122fa93f2fd606d70586f029459e0c9", "ja": "星梨花、どんな曲がいい？", "zh": "星梨花，你想要什么样的歌曲？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "d32cc4f69da458ff1e26a92e4511abed24f7285addda65017aa49264f49a8de1", "ja": "え？　どんな曲ですか？\nえっと……えっと。うーん……。", "zh": "诶？要什么样的歌曲？\n那个……那个。嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "22671bf28fbc3a815a87b7f77fabac49a482958e372883496dc1ce8602918344", "ja": "はいはーいっ！　私、女子力高い曲がいいな～。\nせりりんにピッタリなやつ！", "zh": "好——！我想要一首很有女孩子气的歌～。\n特别适合星梨花的那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "b8449a4b6411ce7cb0fa09c9e04450c1c6078a92d004a62d3b0738c60b03d02a", "ja": "私はカワイイのがいいと思います！\nだって星梨花のだし♪", "zh": "我觉得可爱的比较好！毕竟是星梨花的嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cb247dcaba4934d12e63006d2a0a868039cd46bbbe7e35f75c6ca16233e4e572", "ja": "うん、よさそうだな！　それで星梨花本人はどうだ？\n歌ってみたい曲、とかでもいいんだぞ？", "zh": "嗯，听起来挺不错的！那么星梨花本人怎么想呢？\n比如想唱唱看什么样的歌，都可以说说看哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "2e0b802e50692c4448c88081e13c71e64cae2afe01025847a6b98cf8a75bd3bc", "ja": "あっ、あの、もう少しだけ待ってもらえませんか？\nわたし、一生けんめい考えます！", "zh": "啊，那个，能再等我一会儿吗？\n我会努力想想的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b9d7e259c3156d76fb1aa9b128ac6c8ab88df852511b570cda8b008431075388", "ja": "……そうか。うん、いいことだ。\nまだまだ時間はあるから、ゆっくり考えてみようか。", "zh": "……这样啊。嗯，这是件好事。\n时间还很充裕，慢慢想想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "6392f84437057933374a38bb831f4ccb2dcc0124eb461078d16f1fd19112b238", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます！\nわたしが、歌いたい曲……。うーん……。", "zh": "好的，谢谢您！\n我想唱的歌……嗯……m", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_069_1024_p", "source_sha256": "639dbce2f01e7e0ad3e61b219de031a0de14d84f1544336518556ceea3bd3680", "ja": "（……しっかりと考えてるみたいだな。\nどんな答えを見つけるか、楽しみにしていよう！）", "zh": "（……看起来在认真思考啊。\n期待着她会找到什么样的答案吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
